# CUSTOMIZATION
# ============================================================================
# 
# Disable specific checks:
#   Comment out the check section
# 
# Add custom checks:
#   Add new sections following the same pattern
# 
# Adjust severity:
#   Change exit 1 to continue for warnings
# 
